<title>UK: LME copper pops above $2,500 in pre-market.</title>
<headline>LME copper pops above $2,500 in pre-market.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ticks above $2,500 resistance, last quoted at $2,507/11, versus Monday's $2,488. LME stocks draw of 2,750 tonnes supportive. Cash/threes back little changed at $70/$75.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Touch firmer, holding steady above $1,600.</p>
<p>Resistance at $1,610-$1,620.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Marginally firmer.</p>
</text>
